<td tEditID="c1r3" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r3" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial; margin: 0in 0in 16.8pt; line-height: 16.8pt; background: white;"><span class="fontsizesmall"><span style="font-size:8.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:#242424">^^Void
where prohibited. Open to legal residents of the 50 US states and DC, age 18+
(19+ in NE and AL; 21+ in MS) at entry. Begins 12:00 a.m. ET on 05/01/23; ends
11:59 p.m. ET on 05/31/23. No purchase or donation necessary. To enter, either
present to donate blood at an American Red Cross blood donation facility or
send an email to&nbsp;<a href="mailto:customercare@redcross.org"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#A4262C">customercare@redcross.org</span></a>&nbsp;to
enter free of charge and include the Giveaway name, “American Red Cross 2023
All-Star Weekend Giveaway.” One (1) winner will receive a trip for two (2) to
the 2023 MLB<sup>®&nbsp;</sup>All-Star Game<sup>®</sup>&nbsp;in Seattle,
Washington. Total ARV of all prizes: $7,000 US. Odds of winning depend on
number of entries received. Full Official Rules&nbsp;<a href="https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https://www.redcrossblood.org/local-homepage/events/fanatics.html?cid%3DFanatics%26med%3Dreferral%26source%3Dweb_directmail_broadcastvm_tr&amp;data=05%7c01%7ccourtney.brown2%40redcross.org%7c80e04eae9fd54619159d08db482a82d8%7cdd5b5d42c0d34ad2b5f160edb3af2771%7c0%7c0%7c638183119639446400%7cUnknown%7cTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7c3000%7c%7c%7c&amp;sdata=6gkKYi9yVSiZQEYQ3j1OXVwEP4vrd7Xld4HZ0FUdhro%3D&amp;reserved=0"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#A4262C">click here</span></a>.
Sponsor: American Red Cross. Fanatics is a registered trademark of Fanatics,
LLC. All rights reserved. The prize shall not be sold on any internet site and
any ticket that has been re-sold via the internet will be nullified. Major
League Baseball trademarks and copyrights are used with permission of Major
League Baseball. Visit MLB.com. Major League Baseball has not offered or
sponsored this giveaway in any way.​​​​​​​</span></span><span style="font-size:
8.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:#242424"><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p style="margin: 0in 0in 16.8pt; line-height: 16.8pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;"><span style="color: rgb(20, 20, 20); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="" size="1">^Offer applicable to presenting donors only during the following dates: 05/20/2023-05/31/2023 and while supplies last. Offer subject to availability of donation opportunities in presenting donor’s area. No substitutions and not transferable by presenting donor. Not redeemable for cash.</font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><span style="font-size:8.0pt"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>]]></td>
